WEBVTT

00:01:11.470 --> 00:01:24.200
Divertron is in danger!

00:01:31.500 --> 00:01:40.220
Now, this week's Transformers, after the fierce battle between the Cybertron Corps and the Pestron Corps that caused the Vector Sigma to be out of control,

00:01:40.400 --> 00:01:44.120
continued to protect the tranquility of the Sabertron.

00:01:44.540 --> 00:01:53.180
However, one day, the Sabertron's mother computer, the Vector Sigma, made an incredible discovery.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:17.140
And Sound Blaster, who was collecting information,

00:02:18.380 --> 00:02:20.600
caught this secret and reported it to Galvatron.

00:02:21.500 --> 00:02:24.300
So the Sabertron system will be involved in a new crisis.

00:02:25.560 --> 00:02:29.180
Amazing! It's a treasure hunt!

00:02:37.390 --> 00:02:38.310
I see. It's huge.

00:02:47.100 --> 00:02:47.900
What does that mean?

00:02:49.000 --> 00:02:51.660
Vector Sigma has started manufacturing Sabert Neuron.

00:02:53.160 --> 00:02:54.930
Sabert Neuron?

00:02:55.720 --> 00:02:58.820
It's a super-powerful machine that can go hundreds of times faster than the Sabert Neuron.

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:00.880
It's a powerful Miracle Walking.

00:03:01.380 --> 00:03:04.790
It's amazing! If I can get it,

00:03:04.870 --> 00:03:12.450
I'll have no enemies!

00:03:13.810 --> 00:03:22.070
The control of the entire universe is as it is.

00:03:22.430 --> 00:03:23.860
It's a rare opportunity.

00:03:24.280 --> 00:03:27.590
It's a white thing that can only be made by Vector Sigma.

00:03:30.380 --> 00:03:33.960
That's right. How are we going to solve this problem?

00:03:34.140 --> 00:03:38.030
That's easy. We'll split it between the Sabertron and the Bundle.

00:03:38.310 --> 00:03:41.270
Split it between the Sabertron and the Bundle.

00:03:42.080 --> 00:03:43.960
On the other hand, we were a little late with the Sound Blaster,

00:03:45.040 --> 00:03:48.710
but Twincast also got the same information and reported it to Rodimus.

00:03:49.490 --> 00:03:52.680
If it's completed, it'll be very useful.

00:04:03.900 --> 00:04:05.020
What do you think, everyone?

00:04:05.120 --> 00:04:07.000
Huh? What do you mean, oh, ouch!

00:04:08.760 --> 00:04:11.040
You're not getting better, are you? You're not getting better, are you?

00:04:11.880 --> 00:04:12.220
You're not getting better, are you?

00:04:12.220 --> 00:04:12.660
There's no way to say that!

00:04:14.510 --> 00:04:17.830
Is it okay for us to be training all the time?

00:04:18.750 --> 00:04:21.110
It's important, you know! For the sake of the moment!

00:04:21.650 --> 00:04:22.030
Huh?

00:04:22.300 --> 00:04:26.800
Hey, do you want to have a fight with Destron from here, Chromedome?

00:04:27.340 --> 00:04:28.360
I didn't say that.

00:04:28.600 --> 00:04:29.980
It's just, Captain...

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:32.850
You always say that fighting is not the only way to victory.

00:04:33.190 --> 00:04:34.420
There should be other ways to protect yourself.

00:04:35.780 --> 00:04:38.700
That's right. The one with a lot of blood is the one with injuries.

00:04:39.390 --> 00:04:40.620
Tch. You're talking nonsense.

00:04:41.720 --> 00:04:48.660
But at that time, the evil Gunga Galvatron was preparing a terrible plan.

00:04:49.720 --> 00:04:57.460
Then, let us join the Sabertron as the first unit.

00:04:57.460 --> 00:04:59.980
That's right. The Sabertron Guard Force...

00:05:00.120 --> 00:05:01.960
Get ready to attack so that they don't notice.

00:05:02.180 --> 00:05:02.780
Understood.

00:05:07.940 --> 00:05:10.710
Scorponok?

00:05:10.970 --> 00:05:16.290
Lord Galvatron, are you going to carry out this plan no matter what?

00:05:17.670 --> 00:05:21.630
How dare you! Are you going to oppose it no matter what?

00:05:21.830 --> 00:05:24.480
There is no guarantee that the Miracle Gold will be completed.

00:05:25.480 --> 00:05:28.790
It's a reckless plan to take away the Sabertron planet by force.

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:32.860
What? Are you going to order me around?

00:05:33.240 --> 00:05:35.960
No, I don't want to make a wasteful sacrifice.

00:05:36.900 --> 00:05:39.520
I'll decide if it's a waste or not! Get ready!

00:05:39.960 --> 00:05:41.600
Galvatron, who decided to do this,

00:05:42.600 --> 00:05:46.200
decided to use his power to sabotage the Sabertron-type plan

00:05:46.200 --> 00:05:46.520
that can't be separated from Vector Sigma.

00:06:01.520 --> 00:06:08.870
You guys, I have no idea what to do with this plan.

00:06:09.310 --> 00:06:11.230
Get Galvatron involved somehow.

00:06:11.870 --> 00:06:12.800
Yes, sir!

00:06:13.500 --> 00:06:19.390
But Twincast, who caught Galvatron's movement,

00:06:20.910 --> 00:06:22.390
immediately reported to Rodimus.

00:06:23.250 --> 00:06:25.730
What? The Decepticon Headmasters too?

00:06:26.330 --> 00:06:29.380
That's right. I don't know what they're up to, but...

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:30.480
It seems he's hiding something.

00:06:31.080 --> 00:06:33.740
If it's my memory, it must be San Shizuka.

00:06:33.860 --> 00:06:35.380
He's making me think.

00:06:35.980 --> 00:06:37.540
San Shizuka? What is that?

00:06:37.780 --> 00:06:41.020
It's Galvatron's one-week-long operation.

00:06:42.030 --> 00:06:44.350
So it's three days of silence and four days of rampage?

00:06:44.930 --> 00:06:47.040
That's right. It's the data since his appearance.

00:06:49.030 --> 00:06:50.750
Commander, I'm going to fly to Earth right away.

00:06:51.070 --> 00:06:51.650
Me too!

00:06:51.850 --> 00:06:52.810
I'll be right back.

00:06:53.070 --> 00:06:54.160
You're late!

00:06:54.680 --> 00:06:55.520
It'll be too late after the incident!

00:06:57.990 --> 00:06:59.620
Wait, Chromedome!

00:07:00.090 --> 00:07:00.830
Ouch!

00:07:01.900 --> 00:07:06.000
All right, just watch. Don't move.

00:07:07.100 --> 00:07:08.330
Yes, sir!

00:07:09.180 --> 00:07:11.910
But at that time, the Sabertron...

00:07:11.930 --> 00:07:21.600
Over there!

00:07:31.980 --> 00:07:32.820
Why is the Animatron unit here?

00:07:33.360 --> 00:07:34.920
We'll find them!

00:07:38.530 --> 00:07:40.380
Hurry up and contact the commander!

00:07:43.290 --> 00:07:43.650
No...

00:08:00.800 --> 00:08:04.270
If that's the case, it'll be boring.

00:08:04.870 --> 00:08:07.720
I won't say anything bad. Just cooperate with the plan.

00:08:08.260 --> 00:08:11.330
Don't be stupid. Galvatron is not going to release me.

00:08:12.560 --> 00:08:13.800
First of all, I have to think for the sake of Destron.

00:08:15.000 --> 00:08:18.490
What do you think will happen if the Miracle Gold is completed and the Autobots get it?

00:08:19.870 --> 00:08:22.450
What? Is there a guarantee that it will be completed?

00:08:22.830 --> 00:08:25.190
There is no guarantee that it will not be completed.

00:08:26.970 --> 00:08:29.810
I see. In other words, the dangerous eyes are fast.

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:31.020
and take them down before they're too late.

00:08:31.660 --> 00:08:32.380
Yes, sir!

00:08:32.460 --> 00:08:34.200
We'll take them down at once,

00:08:34.400 --> 00:08:35.400
and save the Sabertron!

00:08:36.100 --> 00:08:37.830
I'm so proud of you!

00:09:00.700 --> 00:09:04.430
Hizuka, where are the Decepticon Headmasters?

00:09:06.060 --> 00:09:07.500
But at that time...

00:09:07.500 --> 00:09:07.660
What?

00:09:38.120 --> 00:09:39.700
The Cybertron will be yours!

00:09:41.060 --> 00:09:56.040
The Cybertron guards are exhausted from the sudden attack.

00:09:57.860 --> 00:09:59.480
They try their best to eat him alive.

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:03.510
On the other hand, Rodimus received an urgent message.

00:10:03.630 --> 00:10:09.330
What? The Sabertron planet has been attacked by the Decepticons?

00:10:09.610 --> 00:10:11.270
Everyone, prepare to leave immediately!

00:10:13.550 --> 00:10:17.160
Also, send a support force from Earth to Ultra Magnus.

00:10:17.720 --> 00:10:18.120
What?

00:10:25.740 --> 00:10:27.170
That's what I was going to say.

00:10:27.450 --> 00:10:29.190
But I don't want to leave.

00:10:32.300 --> 00:10:33.900
I can't take care of you any more.

00:10:37.480 --> 00:10:42.810
Commander, please listen to me.

00:10:42.970 --> 00:10:44.250
Sorry, but I don't have time.

00:10:44.610 --> 00:10:46.190
Can you talk to me while you walk?

00:10:47.360 --> 00:10:52.150
To be honest, I don't want you to go out.

00:10:52.450 --> 00:10:54.410
What? What do you mean?

00:10:54.590 --> 00:10:57.520
If you go out, Galvatron will be in trouble.

00:10:57.700 --> 00:10:59.400
Rather than making more sacrifices for his allies...

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:01.080
There must be another way.

00:11:02.000 --> 00:11:05.040
No, I can't ask Fortress for that.

00:11:05.880 --> 00:11:06.620
I understand the importance of the Miracle Gold.

00:11:07.940 --> 00:11:10.340
But I don't know if it will be completed yet.

00:11:10.900 --> 00:11:12.260
There is no other way to survive without fighting in vain.

00:11:15.000 --> 00:11:16.430
There's something more important.

00:11:17.350 --> 00:11:23.350
The Sabertron planet is our mother planet.

00:11:23.690 --> 00:11:25.000
We can't give it to the Decepticons.

00:11:48.110 --> 00:11:50.090
I can't believe it was Saber who was after them.

00:11:50.570 --> 00:11:51.960
It's a long story.

00:11:52.240 --> 00:11:52.820
Let's hurry!

00:11:53.060 --> 00:11:54.900
Chromedome, shouldn't we contact the Commander?

00:11:57.320 --> 00:11:58.340
Oh, that's true.

00:12:04.790 --> 00:12:05.130
How was it?

00:12:06.490 --> 00:12:08.610
Rodimus' determination is harder than I thought.

00:12:09.590 --> 00:12:10.370
Thank you for watching!

00:12:15.480 --> 00:12:17.560
We'll head straight to the Sabertron ship, so tell the commander!

00:12:18.580 --> 00:12:21.220
You're going to Sabertron? Hey, Chromedome!

00:12:22.230 --> 00:12:22.670
See you over there!

00:12:23.480 --> 00:12:23.620
See ya!

00:12:24.790 --> 00:12:25.810
Chromedome, don't be hasty!

00:12:27.670 --> 00:12:27.910
Alright!

00:12:28.380 --> 00:12:28.960
We're on the same side as the Sabertrons.

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:30.100
Let's go!

00:12:47.660 --> 00:12:47.880
Let's go!

00:13:05.750 --> 00:13:06.210
At that time...

00:13:06.840 --> 00:13:08.200
They want indiscriminate and unbiased attacks.

00:13:09.530 --> 00:13:10.370
The Decepticons have been dispatched.

00:13:11.000 --> 00:13:11.840
is approaching the Autobots' headquarters.

00:13:30.000 --> 00:13:31.700
It's the same as twisting your face!

00:13:31.700 --> 00:13:32.800
You're heavy, Shige!

00:13:34.140 --> 00:13:46.870
The new Autobotron has appeared.

00:13:47.050 --> 00:13:48.850
I'll crush all the summer cows that are flying around!

00:13:51.010 --> 00:13:58.690
Where's the restaurant Headmasters?

00:13:59.090 --> 00:13:59.790
Come out!

00:14:03.450 --> 00:14:06.360
They're out. That's as far as I can go!

00:14:06.820 --> 00:14:10.070
You two are very brave. I'll take good care of you.

00:14:10.510 --> 00:14:23.260
In a three-on-two battle, when the Chrome Dome was struggling,

00:14:23.780 --> 00:14:25.510
Fortress, the first battleship, arrived.

00:14:39.850 --> 00:14:41.390
Chromedome and Hardhead are...

00:14:41.740 --> 00:14:42.280
I wonder where they are.

00:14:42.680 --> 00:14:44.200
From above, we can see them better.

00:14:45.130 --> 00:14:46.930
As soon as we find them, we'll carry out an effective defense operation.

00:15:03.390 --> 00:15:03.830
This is terrible.

00:15:04.390 --> 00:15:11.210
Combine!

00:15:11.590 --> 00:15:12.090
Transform!

00:15:15.480 --> 00:15:15.980
Transform!

00:15:17.340 --> 00:15:22.030
Combine!

00:15:32.080 --> 00:15:33.320
Merion, combine with Velion!

00:15:33.560 --> 00:15:45.740
There they are! They're fighting with the Decepticon Headmasters!

00:15:46.660 --> 00:15:48.170
Looks like they're having a hard time.

00:15:49.850 --> 00:15:52.310
Those two won't be able to pull it off now.

00:15:52.450 --> 00:15:53.390
Support them!

00:15:53.690 --> 00:15:55.470
We'll have to take care of them.

00:16:04.610 --> 00:16:08.700
I won't forgive you today. I'll beat you to death so you can never fight again.

00:16:11.200 --> 00:16:15.560
Don't be silly. I'll get the Sabertron's Miracle Gold.

00:16:18.670 --> 00:16:26.220
Sabertron

00:16:38.000 --> 00:16:38.420
Transform!

00:16:38.760 --> 00:16:44.980
They're as cowardly as ever.

00:16:45.240 --> 00:16:47.590
Now that I've got my eyes on them...

00:17:03.260 --> 00:17:20.680
Hey, Otaron, give me a hand!

00:17:21.100 --> 00:17:24.160
Hey, don't be so reckless! I'm going to fight, so don't do that!

00:17:31.630 --> 00:17:36.710
I've finally done it! I'll finish you off!

00:17:36.910 --> 00:17:38.640
Mr. Galvatron.

00:17:39.060 --> 00:17:39.360
What?

00:17:39.720 --> 00:17:40.980
Over there.

00:17:41.340 --> 00:17:41.880
Is that all?

00:17:42.220 --> 00:17:45.850
No, it's the big news that I don't want the Autobots to hear.

00:17:47.030 --> 00:17:48.800
At this critical moment?

00:17:50.600 --> 00:17:57.200
I-I-I have a chance! Hurry, hurry! Commander, Commander!

00:18:00.480 --> 00:18:00.920
Shuriken!

00:18:01.280 --> 00:18:06.520
What? The production formula for the Miracle Gold has been completed?

00:18:07.230 --> 00:18:11.360
Perfect. Vector Sigma will start production immediately.

00:18:11.940 --> 00:18:13.300
Alright, we've defeated Rodimus.

00:18:14.280 --> 00:18:16.660
Let's destroy all the Cybertrons in the entire Mars!

00:18:16.840 --> 00:18:23.560
If we do that, we won't be able to make a single mistake.

00:18:24.260 --> 00:18:25.770
We have to completely destroy all the Cybertrons.

00:18:32.270 --> 00:18:35.850
If I can, I don't want to keep fighting.

00:18:36.350 --> 00:18:38.170
I have to get rid of Rodimus somehow.

00:19:04.160 --> 00:19:08.450
If the Decepticons lose and the Miracle Gold is in the hands of the Autobots...

00:19:08.450 --> 00:19:21.370
The Miracle Gold can't be in the hands of the Autobots.

00:19:21.950 --> 00:19:26.960
There's only one way out.

00:19:26.980 --> 00:19:29.550
A new era...

00:19:30.250 --> 00:19:32.230
The Sabertron planet will be completely destroyed!

00:19:35.690 --> 00:19:37.950
Weird Wolf, Skull, wipe out!

00:19:38.820 --> 00:19:56.510
We'll continue this later! Stay tuned!

00:20:02.620 --> 00:20:10.520
So, what's the way to crush them all at once?

00:20:11.580 --> 00:20:14.200
We've prepared a special explosive device.

00:20:14.860 --> 00:20:17.100
There are three of them.

00:20:17.500 --> 00:20:20.360
Once you set them up, you can't take them off.

00:20:20.920 --> 00:20:23.340
We'll blow them away like the Sabertron.

00:20:25.550 --> 00:20:27.220
Like the Sabertron?

00:20:28.020 --> 00:20:28.580
That's right.

00:20:29.550 --> 00:20:29.950
That's...

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:32.480
Do you think we'll have time to escape after we've set up the trap?

00:20:33.020 --> 00:20:36.520
Don't worry. We'll get all the Decepticons to retreat.

00:20:37.360 --> 00:20:41.490
Wipe will set them up. Weird Wolf and Skull will support them.

00:20:41.810 --> 00:20:42.190
Yes, sir!

00:20:43.500 --> 00:20:44.240
O-Origo!

00:20:45.380 --> 00:20:49.140
Scolponok and the Decepticons are trying to carry out the Sabertron-based explosion plan.

00:20:52.970 --> 00:20:56.860
Will they continue to fight without knowing about this terrible plan?

00:20:58.260 --> 00:20:59.580
How will the Autobots...

00:21:00.000 --> 00:21:00.440
Don't move up.

00:21:34.540 --> 00:21:34.720
Check.
